# inc-w91w: fire the bow at the EMPTY square of a found trap, three squares
# east, through the real fire key and the location cursor.
# NOTE: lowercase f; uppercase F sets SHIFT and fires in a direction.
# `s` passes one turn so the vision pass sees the room the probe rebuilt;
# before it the prompt calls every square "unseen area".
@while "-- more --" SPACE
s
f
l
RIGHT*3
@dump:shot-cursor
ENTER
@while "Really fire" y
@while "-- more --" SPACE
@dump:shot-after
@quit
